AIChess (MIT) loads Stockfish at runtime from the jsDelivr CDN
(cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/stockfish.js@10.0.2) when public/engines/stockfish.js
is only a placeholder. Stockfish is licensed under GPL-3.0. The engine binary
is not redistributed in this repository; the CDN copy is fetched by the browser.
See https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish for Stockfish licence terms.
